  "topPRs": [
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOLB-lzc6nPY0S",
      "title": "Safer Safes - Safe Extensions v2",
      "author": "alcueca",
      "number": 761,
      "body": "Specs for [LivenessModuleV2](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/design-docs/pull/320) and [TimelockGuard](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/design-docs/pull/324), combined into a single contract as **Safe Extensions V2**, replacing Safe Extensions.\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/specs",
      "createdAt": "2025-09-07T06:58:32Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 573,
      "deletions": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOLB-lzc7YBHh-",
      "title": "Post-Execution transaction and SDM specs",
      "author": "nonsense",
      "number": 908,
      "body": "This changeset defines **post-execution transaction** specs and the version-1 **Sequencer-Defined Metering (SDM)** specs.\r\n\r\n   ## Changes\r\n\r\n   - Add Post-Execution Transaction envelope spec (`0x7D`)\r\n   - Add SDM version-1 payload schema\r\n   - Define refund application, canonical gas accounting, and fee settlement\r\n   - Add glossary and summary entries\r\n   - Clarify that verifiers trust refunds included by the sequencer rather than recomputing them\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism/issues/20182",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/specs",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-04T12:58:24Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-06-04T14:21:31Z",
      "additions": 527,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOLB-lzc7h-LU2",
      "title": "Add Safer Safes contract spec",
      "author": "mds1",
      "number": 914,
      "body": "## Summary\n- add a high-level Safer Safes contract spec focused on assumptions and invariants\n- document liveness recovery, transaction timelock, combined timing, cancellation, guard-removal, and module-scope properties\n- link the new spec from the protocol Safe Extensions section\n\nReplaces #761.\n\n## Verification\n- `just lint-specs-md-check`\n- `just lint-specs-spelling-check`\n- `just lint-specs-toc-check`\n- `just build`",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/specs",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-02T21:13:44Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-06-03T21:23:41Z",
      "additions": 406,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOLB-lzc6GY7y1",
      "title": "[Jovian] Add specs for consensus event nonces (deposits + config changes)",
