      "body": "<!--\r\nContributions welcome! See https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/.github/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\r\n-->\r\n\r\n**Description**\r\n\r\nAdd specs for https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/specs/issues/330#issuecomment-2354217166.\r\nTracker issue: https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism/issues/13543\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nWe're excited to get this change out as we see it as a precursor to #478, which is useful for our L3s.",
